==Point Cap Advice==
To help those aiming to earn the most amount of points this league, we thought we'd shed some light on some key information you should know!

For starters, all regions will give the same amount of points to allow for a bit more flexibilty and let you decide on the content you enjoy most while you blaze through your task list.

Secondly, there are a few caveats you'll want to keep in mind when planning which regions you do choose to get the maximum amount of points:

* You will want at least one raid to get all 3 mega rares
* You will need to be able to fill 750 Collection Log slots
* You will need to be able to complete 10 different bosses Combat Achievements
* You will need to be able to complete 30 CA Speed Tasks
* You will need to be able to complete 250 CA tasks total
* You will need to reach the Elite tier of the Combat Achievements
* Additionally, you'll need to be able to get to 50M XP in each skill

As long as your regions meet the above criteria you should be able to reach the point cap. Any league or diary tasks which an area has which are deemed incompleteable through an oversight will be autocompleted at some point after launch to keep a level of fairness across those competing.

Finally, just to give you a little extra, there's 4 new XP tasks which you might want to keep in mind when choosing your relics:

* Obtain 100 million experience in a skill excluding Attack, Strength, Defence, Magic, Ranged & Hitpoints
* Obtain 100 million experience in either Attack, Strength, Defence, Magic, Ranged, Hitpoints or Prayer
* Obtain 200 million experience in any non-combat skill
* Obtain 200 million experience in either Attack, Strength, Defence, Magic, Ranged, Hitpoints or Prayer

Best of luck to you all!

==FAQ==
As we begin to reveal more and more information, we'll try to gather the most frequently asked questions and update them here. So keep an eye on this section for frequent updates!

Head on over to the official [https://discord.gg/OSRS OSRS Discord] and add your question into the '''#leagues-vi-faq''' channel or join the community-run [https://discord.gg/fVJA6b4JdZ Leagues Discord] to find plenty of discussion and speculation!

===Varlamore===
====Will the Hunter's Guild shop be accessible from level 1 Hunter?====
No, there are Bird snares and Hunter boxes in the Civitas General Store though if you were worried about that!

====How will Runecraft be approached since there is no early game way to train Runecraft?====
Varlamore does have ways to train Runecraft unconventionally, so we've made no changes to embrace the spirit of the strange starting zone.

Most other area unlocks do provide more convenient and easier ways to train. Luckily with access to the abyss, you can get talismans fairly easily.

===Access & Areas===
====Will there be access to an essence mine? (without picking Kandarin?)====
No

====Have Quests, Achievement Diaries, and Clues been looked into with Misthalin presumably blocked?====
Yes

====With Misthalin burning, how will Wilderness pickers access the Edgeville dungeon in the wild?====
The Edgeville dungeon will not be accessible in this league

====How many hours into the league is Karamja unlocked? Is it unlocked for everyone at the same time, or when your account hits a certain progression milestone?====
Should be within the first few hours - tied to tasks completed, like other regions

====Will GOTR and Leviathan be accessible with just Desert?====
Players will be able to access the Temple of the Eye through a portal near Emir's arena in the desert.

====Will Lithkren be accessible without Fossil Island?====
No

====Are we able to access all 3 Raids without having that region unlocked?====
No, to access a raid you'll need to unlock it's region.

====With no Tormented Demons available and Arceuus spellbook locked to a region, will players have access to Demonbane?====
No spoilers, but it's covered

====Will Pest Control have its XP rewards re-enabled this year as a perk of the region?====
No

===Bosses===
====Will we still be able to fight Yama in Kourend?====
Yes

====Have purples in CoX been looked? Regarding better frequency compared to the other 2 raids.====
Arcane and Dex scrolls now have significantly less weighting in CM CoX raids.

====Knowing that more bosses were instanced as of last League, can we expect more instances incoming?====
Nothing is currently planned, but if there are any clear standouts, please let us know!

====Is Sire a globally accessible boss, or are they locked away by Misthalin as well?====
Zanaris and the Abyss will still be accessible

===Items===
====Are we getting back gear dropping in their complete form, or will it revert to requiring the regions for assembling items?====
Gear will drop as it's usable completed form if the original drop is not usable in any form. For example, the Hydra Leather will drop as Ferocious Gloves but the Avernic Treads will '''NOT''' drop as Avernic Treads (max)

====Will Beginner clue scrolls be accessible, as the steps are f2p areas only?====
Beginner clues will not have tasks this league but will be completable if players unlock regions with beginner steps.

They will still drop, and players with Asgarnia/Desert can complete them

====Could Wildy pickers have access to Ancient Warrior Equipment, also would it be usable outside the Wilderness?====
No

====Can you give Yama Dairy rewards for Wilderness since Misthalin is gone?====
See above

====Is the Smouldering stone drop boosted from Hellhounds in the Wildy Slayer Cave this league?====
This has been fixed

====Will there be a way to get Ava's accumulator if picking Fremennik?====
Ava's Assembler will be dropped instead of a Vorkath Head

====Will Morytania have 'Equip a Dragon Defender' task allowed to be completed by dismantling an Averneric defender?====
No, some areas may have tasks that are technically possible but we are intentionally balancing areas around the tasks that are assigned to them.

====Will the Dizana's Quiver default to having any ammo saving, or will you still need to add a Vorkath's Head/Ava's Assembler to it? If so, how will you be able to do so if Ava is inaccessible?====
Yes, ammo saving will be enabled for the quiver without access to Misthalin

====Is there any improvement to dryness protection especially for items of a set?====
No

====How will something like the Avernic Treads be handled?====
Avernic Treads will have no changes in the league. They are incredibly strong as is and very usable. Players who unlock Asgarnia will have the option to start upgrading them depending on their other area unlocks.

===Relics===
====Do we expect the time-to-all-relics (on average) to be equivalent to Raging Echoes or faster/slower?====
A similar time.

===Misc===
====Did you fix the whisperer combat achievements? Its an argarnia task but it required either Kourend or the Grimoire relic to complete last league====
Yes, it will be auto completed with Asgarnia now.

====Can we see Misthalin on fire from neighboring regions?====
Sadly not!

====Will league points finally be the exact same for each unlockable region?====
Currently each region sits at the same total points now.

